            "review_title": "Review at Bún Ziu Gánh",
            "review_text": "Anas A\nGothenburg, Sweden859 contributions\n0\nDelicious bun\nJun 2019 • Couples\nVery tasty food and friendly staff. We were exploring the Old Quarter and trying to find a good Vietnamese street food store to have dinner at. Everyone recommended Ta Hien street to us which was overcrowded and noisy. We couldn't withstand a few minutes in there so we decided to explore the city ourselves until we stumbled upon this place which was more of a local experience than a tourist one. I absolutely recommend it to all travelers.\nRead more\nWritten June 4, 2019",
